{"after_excerpt":{"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:e0953b78c0d81651b56b799c02495d66c4dc5429578cffc85569b259e53e86f4","joiner":"","kind":"HTML_TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"44977b3557cf6ec3d400a1311f98bf03ac97b4331cd00f0293511a7c5380110d","raw_text_sha256":"2d55220e01fcfc97b08f161106190e4fde784050856539382f3b65ab96e6e8b4","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":3879,"start":3760,"unit_ref":"html:1"}]},"text":"立租契人系瑞应寺下院当家宗玉，今有二拔子庙上铺面房屋一所，共计十六间，今租沙河德春店作理生意，连借缸三口。对众言定每年租价清钱五十千正，只许客辞主，不许主辞客。房屋损坏，房主修理。恐后无凭，立租帖存照。现收租价清钱三十千正。租价不许增长。","text_sha256":"2d55220e01fcfc97b08f161106190e4fde784050856539382f3b65ab96e6e8b4"},"before_sha256":"fb2845103abef44f85900f24c064d3139ae138b63837902f9f68727aaf817235","before_source":{"bibliography":{"citation":"北京市文物局《寺院土地田产的经营方式（中）》所录“乾隆三十九年僧宗玉立租房契”","url":"https://wwj.beijing.gov.cn/bjww/wwjzzcslm/1731063/1731066/djs/1731072/1731538/index.html"},"carrier_capture":{"ref":"asset:sha256:fa65f0a770344fc760af3411b5fa3a4665d83c73496664f980a4f9ee8191da76","sha256":"fa65f0a770344fc760af3411b5fa3a4665d83c73496664f980a4f9ee8191da76"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc","sha256":"15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc"},"id":"src:history:beijing:1774:rental-contract","locator":{"contract":"乾隆三十九年僧宗玉立租房契","region":"今北京昌平一带"},"locator_verification":{"reason":"EXCERPT_NOT_FOUND","status":"UNVERIFIED"},"notes":"证明乾隆北京地区存在正式房屋租契与租价约定；该契为铺面房，不能证明贾家具体住宅院落或租价。","text":"立租契人系瑞應寺下院當家宗玉，今有二拔子廟上鋪面房屋一所，共計十六間，今租沙河德春店作理生意。對眾言定每年租價清錢五十千正。","text_sha256":"9c7b89292ea329157fe84f5ef33c184dd456f68fe253b99ad7c2abf046055fb8","title":"乾隆三十九年僧宗玉立租房契","type":"HISTORICAL_PRIMARY","witness":{"annotation":"北京市文物局页面录文；乾隆三十九年六月初六日","label":"大觉寺藏清代契约文书","siglum":"BJ-RENT-1774"}},"claim_reviews":[{"claim_id":"claim:history:h04:rental-mechanism","claim_sha256":"33805240e4406709c2c3e706a1fd284515169b6bb940fa840d5f300029504d3a","rationale":"完整契约正文仍明确十六间铺面、每年租价及书面租帖；现有ANALOGICAL关系不把昌平商铺移植成贾府住宅事实。","result":"RETAIN_EXISTING_ASSERTION"},{"claim_id":"claim:history:h05:rental-cost","claim_sha256":"0eca3c24a5fe177b7af67c6d143ab170134d7fc2032e8915431cb0567ed80d89","rationale":"契约有“每年租价清钱五十千正”与“租价不许增长”，足以支持持续租金义务；“现收三十千正”是实收项，不改变或混同约定年租。","result":"RETAIN_EXISTING_ASSERTION"}],"impact":{"claims":[{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h04:rental-mechanism","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"DIRECT_ASSERTION","statement":"乾隆时期北京地区存在书面房屋租赁契约，并可明确约定房屋、租价等事项。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"note":"该契为昌平地区铺面租契，只支持租赁机制，不证明贾府住宅形态。","relation":"ANALOGICAL","source":"src:history:beijing:1774:rental-contract"}]},{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h05:rental-cost","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"DIRECT_ASSERTION","statement":"清代北京地区房屋租赁可形成持续租金义务。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"relation":"ANALOGICAL","source":"src:history:beijing:1774:rental-contract"}]}],"decisions":[],"implementations":[],"title_axes":[]},"impact_sha256":"3d16d867dadb4f5fb9d708e42b8a6f72b38eb802463319b2b4b5bd72a5035a8c","kind":"SOURCE_EXCERPT_CORRECTION","limitations":["此项为代理对本地数字录文及下游主张的复核，不冒充独立人工评审；逐字重取不等于馆藏原件或历史真实性鉴定。","保留原Source ID、type、witness、tier、bibliography和notes，以及全部Claim、Decision、Implementation与TitleAxis记录和权限。"],"omitted_line_breaks":[],"rationale":"采用北京市文物局录文的完整连续契约正文至“租价不许增长。”，恢复“连借缸三口”及被省去的退租、维修、实收租价等约定；保持显示简体及原标点。每年约定五十千与现收三十千属于不同字段，不混同；原两项主张仅说明书面租赁及持续租金义务。","reviewer":{"kind":"AGENT_TEXT_REVIEW","name":"Codex"},"schema_version":1,"source_id":"src:history:beijing:1774:rental-contract"}
